{
  "_about": "TAH-11 v2 todos screen: structure, add, Done/Undo, edit and delete via the row menu, All/Active/Done tabs. Seeds and server checks use /v1/todos (string ids, done flag); the app seeds Buy milk, Write report, Call dentist, so no whole-list counts are asserted. Per-row testids are shared across rows, so edit/delete scenarios mark their row Done via the API and act on the Done tab (nth 0), and the Done-button step takes the last open row (nth -1, rows are listed oldest first). Assumes scenarios run serially (parallelism 1) and leave no completed rows behind.",
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "run_id": "todos-v2",
  "config": {
    "base_url": "http://localhost:3000",
    "parallelism": 1,
    "video": "fail",
    "default_timeout_ms": 15000
  },
  "namespace": {
    "run_id": "todos-v2",
    "email": "qa+todos-v2@example.com",
    "tag": "QA RUN todos-v2"
  },
